OL,3,GNEWSAIsland bracing for 'high tides' on
OL,4,Aexposed coasts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA yellow weather warning for coastal
OL,7,Fovertopping is expected for the Isle of
OL,8,FMan just after midnight.
OL,10,FForecasters at Ronaldsway Met Office
OL,11,Fsaid fresh to strong south-westerly
OL,12,Fwinds will lead to minor coastal
OL,13,Fovertopping with slight debris being
OL,14,Fwashed onto exposed coasts and
OL,15,Fpromenades around the next two high
OL,16,Ftides.
OL,18,FThe warning is in place until 13.45 GMT
OL,19,Fon Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
